><given-names>JM</given-names></name><name><surname>Wetmore</surname><given-names>RS</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>Total hip arthroplasty through a minimally invasive anterior surgical approach</article-title><source>J Bone Joint Surg Am</source><year>2003</year><volume>85</volume><issue>Suppl 4</issue><fpage>39</fpage><lpage>48</lpage></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Kennon RE, Keggi JM, Wetmore RS et al. (2003) Total hip arthroplasty through a minimally invasive anterior surgical approach. J Bone Joint Surg Am 85(Suppl 4):39&#x02013;48 <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">14652392</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR10"><label>10.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Harris</surname><given-names>WH</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Traumatic arthritis of the hip after dislocation and acetabular fractures: treatment by mold arthroplasty. An end-result study using a new method of result evaluation</article-title><source>J Bone Joint Surg Am</source><year>1969</year><volume>51</volume><fpage>737</fpage><lpage>755</lpage></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Harris WH (1969) Traumatic arthritis of the hip after dislocation and acetabular fractures: treatment by mold arthroplasty. An end-result study using a new method of result evaluation. J Bone Joint Surg Am 51:737&#x02013;755 <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">5783851</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR11"><label>11.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Huo</surname><given-names>MH</given-names></name><name><surname>Martin</surname><given-names>RP</given-names></name><name><surname>Zatorski</surname><given-names>LE</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>Total hip arthroplasty using the Zweymuller stem implanted without cement. A prospective study of consecutive patients with minimum 3-year follow-up period</ar